  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 26 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure grand family living in the heart of Murrays Bay, within the highly sought-after Rangi zone. Set on a 670sqm section with an impressive 310sqm floor area, this substantial character home combines timeless warmth, generous proportions and exceptional flexibility for growing and multi-generational families.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces flow effortlessly onto a deck with shade sail and a three-year-old heated saltwater swimming pool. Summer entertaining is sorted, with plenty of room for family and friends to gather.\r\n\r\nTwo additional family rooms provide space for teenagers, extended family or guests, while the third lounge can double as a fifth bedroom when needed.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, four light-filled bedrooms include a master with ensuite, complemented by a versatile study, office or reading nook. With three full bathrooms, busy family life is well catered for.\r\n\r\nOutside, fully fenced lawns and gardens provide a private haven for children and pets, while an internal-access double garage. Loads of dedicated off-street parking for the boat, trailer and beach toys complete the package.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n• 310sqm floor area on a 670sqm section\r\n• Four bedrooms plus a third lounge offering fifth-bedroom flexibility\r\n• Three full bathrooms, including master ensuite\r\n• Three living areas plus open-plan kitchen and dining\r\n• Study, office or reading nook\r\n• Heated saltwater swimming pool and deck with shade sail\r\n• Internal-access double garage and off-street boat parking\r\n• Fully fenced lawn and gardens\r\n• Zoned for Murrays Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of the Bays lifestyle, with the beach, cafes and coastal walkways close by. With sought-after schooling, generous accommodation and exceptional outdoor living, this is a home designed to grow with your family.\r\n\r\nWith the auction approaching, now is the time to act. Arrange your viewing and prepare to secure your place in this sought-after Murrays Bay neighbourhood.",
